  "description": "NETWAN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C122 H108 N12 O22 Tb4,2.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.544-3.889 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.62-111.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb4(μ3-OH)2L6(acac)4]·2.5CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
